/cache/

# Temporary files created by R markdown
*.utf8.md
*.knit.md

# Quarto
/.quarto/
*_cache/
/_freeze/

# API keys -- never commit real keys. The tracked files `api` and `code/api`
# are placeholders only; keep your own key outside the repository or in .Renviron
.Renviron

